Continuously swing your steamsaws around you, dealing 30% weapon damage to adjacent foes each time you attack.

Your chaotic motions make it difficult for anything to hit you, granting [16%, 20%, 23%, 26%, 28% (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] chance to completely negate all damage.

Damage avoidance chance increases with Steampower.

''Make the metal talk!''
